    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "धन्यवाद, verify हो गया है। Priya जी, आपके two-wheeler loan की EMI चार हज़ार दो सौ रुपये है, जिसकी due date अट्ठाईस अक्टूबर थी। छह दिन overdue होने की वजह से पाँच सौ रुपये का charge भी add हो गया है, जो आपके loan terms के हिसाब से लगा है। क्या आप आज इसे online payment link के through clear कर पाएँगी? मैं SMS या WhatsApp पर link भेज सकती हूँ।",
      "verified": true,
      "guard": [],
      "tools": [
        "verify_identity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "borrower",
      "text": "Sorry, kya aap English mein baat kar sakte hain?"
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Sure, I can speak in English. Priya, your two-wheeler loan EMI is four thousand two hundred rupees, due on the twenty-eighth of October. It is six days overdue, so a charge of five hundred rupees has been added as per your loan terms. Can you clear it today? I can send you a secure payment link by SMS or WhatsApp.",
      "verified": true,
      "guard": [],
      "tools": []
    },
    {
      "role": "borrower",
      "text": "Haan, I understand, ji. Can you tell me exactly when this late charge was added to my account?"
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "One moment, let me check the details for you. The charge is added the day after the due date. It is a flat five hundred rupees, not a daily charge, and there is no extra interest on it. Would you like me to send the payment link now?",
      "verified": true,
      "guard": [],
      "tools": [
        "get_policy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "borrower",
      "text": "Theek hai, ji. I can't pay today, but I will pay the full amount, EMI plus the late charge, on the sixth of November, when my salary comes."
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Okay. ठीक है, मैंने note कर लिया है। क्या इसके अलावा कोई और सवाल है?",
      "verified": true,
      "guard": [],
